OL,3,ASamoa leader apologises for Nazi salute
OL,4,Aafter video from 2007 emerges
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamoa's prime minister has apologised
OL,7,Fafter a video emerged of him giving a
OL,8,FNazi salute while saying "Heil Hitler"
OL,9,Fat a family gathering.
OL,11,FIn the seven-second clip filmed in July
OL,12,F2007, Laaulialemalietoa Leuatea Schmidt
OL,13,Fis seen leading about a dozen people in
OL,14,Fthe salute. "Raise your right hand,
OL,15,FHeil Hitler!" he says, then thanks the
OL,16,Fgroup for responding.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
