OL,3,ASamoa leader apologises for Nazi salute
OL,4,Aafter video from 2007 emerges
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchmidt has acknowledged that his words
OL,7,Fand gesture "were inappropriate and
OL,8,Fcapable of causing offence and hurt",
OL,9,Fadding that the clip was recorded at a
OL,10,Fprivate gathering and "not intended for
OL,11,Fthe public".
OL,13,F"I reject Nazism, antisemitism, racism
OL,14,Fand all forms of political extremism,"
OL,15,FSchmidt said in a statement published
OL,16,Fon Facebook on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
